hardsigmoid(x: Tensor)-> Tensor

Applies the element-wise function

.. math::
            ext{Hardsigmoid}(x) =  egin{cases}
        0 &         ext{if~} x \le -3, \
        1 &         ext{if~} x \ge +3, \
        x / 6 + 1 / 2 &     ext{otherwise}
    \end{cases}


See :class:`~oneflow.nn.Hardsigmoid` for more details.
